  "title": "Turkey Lettuce Wraps with Shiitake Mushrooms",
  "description": "This turkey lettuce wraps with shiitake mushrooms recipe uses lean ground turkey, shiitake mushrooms, and lots of water chestnuts for a tasty filling.",
